Circular FingerPrint for covid19 drugs.csv

	This dataset consists of PubChemID and 1024 substructures corresponding to each PubChemID.



	It consists of details of Side Effects / Adverse Drug Reactions (ADR) corresponding to its PubChemID of drug. 
